{"unit_id":"tag:07A6:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。上文定义的函子（functor）<MATH_0002> 和函子（functor）<MATH_0003>（定义见引理 <REF_0001>）互为伴随（adjoint）：\n<MATH_0004>\n关于 <MATH_0005> 及 <MATH_0006> 具有双函子性（bifunctorially）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"bifunctorially","target_term":"双函子性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"伴随函子对应的态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"导出拉回与直像"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"函子伴随性"},{"source_term":"bifunctorially","target_term":"双函子性","context":"伴随同构的双函子性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D6E:proof","translation":"由引理 <REF_0001>，可见 <MATH_0001> 伴随于（adjoint）<MATH_0002>。有 <MATH_0003>，见引理 <REF_0002>；因而由伴随函子（adjoint functors）的唯一性（uniqueness），有 <MATH_0004>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于"},{"source_term":"adjoint functors","target_term":"伴随函子"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于","context":"复合伴随关系"},{"source_term":"adjoint functors","target_term":"伴随函子","context":"通过伴随唯一性识别函子"},{"source_term":"uniqueness","target_term":"唯一性","context":"伴随函子唯一性"}],"notes":[]}
